<title>USA: Powertel COO departs company.</title>
<headline>Powertel COO departs company.</headline>
<dateline>WEST POINT, Ga. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Powertel Inc said Monday its chief operating officer, Edward Horner, has left the company.</p>
<p>The company did not elaborate on Horner's departure. Powertel, a wireless personal communications service provider, said that President and Chief Executive Allen Smith will assume Horner's duties.</p>
<p>A spokesman was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
